{
  "name": "13-limit-next-signed-out-no-rules",
  "description": "One account at its limit while the next is signed out, in a workspace with no rules: the builder's own login hits its limit while the only candidate below it is signed out, so the task is held with credential_signed_out and a Needs you item names the signed-out login; the owner signs in again on it, the helper's check passes, the hold closes and the work moves to that login, of another provider, with credential.switched; the continuing run announces the criterion it was on again, passes it and submits, and a reviewer on a third provider passes the task.",
  "covers": [
    "PRD test 8 and Build order, Handoff: one of the five golden traces for a workspace with no rules (milestone 3 plan HT-1, PRD R-7).",
    "PRD Quality requirements, the Handoff milestone's acceptance: one account at its limit while the next is signed out, held, the Needs you item, Sign in again, and on to Done.",
    "PRD Handoff, When no candidate is available: a limit report with a signed-out candidate holds the task with credential_signed_out, not credential_limit; the hold, its step and its item name the first signed-out candidate in the seat's order, here the next login (milestone 3 plan HE-12); the lease clock pauses.",
    "PRD Handoff, Waiting on a sign-in: credential.verified closes the hold, and the work moves to the first available candidate in the seat's order with credential.switched; a handoff to another provider uses the credential's model, empty for a Codex login (milestone 3 plan HE-5).",
    "Milestone 3 plan HE-29: the item is resolved with the choice sign_in_again, because a sign-in request's result closes it.",
    "Milestone 3 plan HD-9 and section 0, fact 28: the continuing run announces again the criterion that had not passed, which is the seat's first event; PRD Recovery time and milestone 3 plan HE-17: 220 seconds, from credential.limit_reached at @t:600 to that criterion.started at @t:820."
  ],
